{
  "id": "T-RIVALSELLERS2",
  "title": "H-RIVALPARITY-1 item C part 2 (measurement, user-approved 2026-09-27): BEFORE/AFTER the host's own daily rebuild of the seller table. Run 1 found the host's CACHED count for energy drink in Murray Hill = 7 (built at load) while a live walk by the same rule = 5 (the client's two shops have an EMPTY product list on the host). This run reads the host's demand for every item the client's Murray Hill liquor store / gym stock, rolls the host past midnight (NewDay -> CompetitionHelper.RunDaily :103-104 rebuilds the table and demand), and reads again on both machines. READ-ONLY levers; NO save",
  "preconditions": "Fixture save1 (host melaus, client Client1). Levers providers / marketdemand / rivalincome deployed on BOTH machines. The client's shops 56 ba:street_fifthavenue (liquor store) and 21 ba:street_fourthstreet (gym) in Murray Hill were found by T-RIVALSELLERS' runtime providers-scan; their shelves are ASSERTED on the client here. The clock lever moves the host to 23:57 through RunMainGameTick; live time then crosses midnight. NOTHING is saved.",
  "instances": 2,
  "vars": {
    "clientPid": "Client1",
    "hostPid": "melaus",
    "session": "save1"
  },
  "oracles_absent": [
    "NullReferenceException",
    "HarmonyException",
    "Patching exception"
  ],
  "oracles_report": [
    "\\[Suppress\\] CompetitionHelper.RunDaily skipped on client",
    "\\[AiRaise\\] "
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "role": "h",
      "cmd": "host",
      "expect_result": "^OK"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "role": "c",
      "cmd": "join",
      "expect_result": "^OK"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "role": "h",
